{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港島杏花邨嶺南中學一名13歲男學生，星期三懷疑在校內被人用手襲擊，東區警區反三合會行動組接手跟進，案件列作普通襲擊，拘捕3人。<br/>\n<br/>\n經調查後，警方昨日分別在東區及深水埗區拘捕3名年齡介乎13至15歲男童，涉嫌普通襲擊。3人已獲准保釋候查，須於下月中旬向警方報到。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:18:37.151399+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T02:44:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:54:01.072123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:12:02.579179+00:00","content_hash":"bff09f0c1f8754521ecc9de372810a439536620ba1d2fd4a25804dc02f5cf7a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}